    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, our company's reference with a regional hospital group, where our company's piloted an assistant for medical documentation integrated with a regional hospital group, where we piloted an assistant for medical documentation integrated with their electronic patient record electronic patient record, is directly relevant to The project. our company's have partnerships with OuraneCloud, a French sovereign cloud provider, and Ligeo Santé, a health-IT integrator, which will enable our company's to meet the client's requirements for integration with the hospital information system, electronic patient record, and support for health interoperability standards like HL7, FHIR, and the national health identifier. our company's available capacity includes a dedicated team with necessary roles such as project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, ensuring our company's can deliver the required AI assistance solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's governance practices, including a joint steering committee and operational committee, will facilitate effective communication and decision-making with the client throughout The project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these capabilities and experiences, our company's are well-positioned to submit a tender response that addresses the client's needs for an AI assistance solution, integration requirements, and rollout strategy, all within the specified budget of 900,000 euros over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an AI solution with a response time below 2 seconds, high availability (99.9%), and integration with hospital information systems, electronic patient records, and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also support health interoperability standards such as HL7, FHIR, and the national health identifier, and be hosted on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement, state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED or NOT COVERED by our current stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requirements can be addressed as follows: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Response time below 2 seconds: FULLY COVERED. our platform's performance metrics indicate a median latency of 1.3 seconds, with common queries having a p95 latency below 2 seconds. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "High availability (99.9%): FULLY COVERED. our have an availability target of 99.9%, which aligns with The client requirement. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with hospital information systems: PARTIALLY COVERED." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our platform's has API-first design and supports integration, but specific integration with hospital information systems would require custom adapters or connectors, which our can develop. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with electronic patient records: PARTIALLY COVERED." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Similar to hospital information systems, Our platform's API design allows for integration, but specific integration details may need customization. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with user directories: FULLY COVERED. our support integration with user directories via SAML, OIDC, LDAP, and Entra ID. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Support for health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR, national health identifier): PARTIALLY COVERED." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our platform's supports health interoperability standards through our partner Ligeo Santé, specifically mentioning the FHIR HL7 connector, but our may need to extend or customize supports to fully meet the client's requirements. 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting on sovereign infrastructure within the EU: FULLY COVERED. our offer hosting options on the Sovereign HDS tier, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified, and located within the EU, meeting the client's sovereignty and compliance requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Proposed architecture: Our platform's will be deployed on OuraneCloud's Sovereign HDS tier to ensure compliance with the client's hosting requirements. our will utilize our existing API design to integrate with hospital information systems, electronic patient records, and user directories, developing custom adapters or connectors as needed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our platform's will leverage its built-in support for health interoperability standards, potentially extending or customizing its built-in support for health interoperability standards through our partnership with our partner Ligeo Santé. our containerization using Kubernetes ensures scalability and high availability, meeting the client's performance and uptime requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires strict GDPR compliance, including data sovereignty, encryption, and pseudonymisation of sensitive data, as well as compliance with regulatory requirements such as medical confidentiality and health data protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also be hosted on infrastructure that holds French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls and measures can we propose to ensure compliance with these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the Security and Compliance officer at we, the Security and Compliance officer at Faber IA can confirm that we has experience delivering solutions compliant with GDPR for public-sector and health clients, including special-category health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the client's requirements, we can propose the following security controls and measures:  we are ISO 27001 certified since 2023, which covers development, delivery, and operations, ensuring a robust information security management system. we infrastructure is operated on OuraneCloud, a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud, which meets the client's requirement for data sovereignty. we use encryption in transit via TLS 1.3 and at rest using AES-256 to protect sensitive data. we also implement pseudonymisation where relevant, further protecting sensitive information. we key management is based on EU-based infrastructure, ensuring alignment with GDPR requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we have a Data Protection Officer appointed and maintain a data processing register, which facilitates compliance with GDPR obligations. we solution must be hosted on HDS-certified infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Fortunately, we hosting partner, OuraneCloud, holds the HDS certification, ensuring that Our solution meets this critical requirement. we also provide a Data Processing Agreement aligned with GDPR Article 28, guaranteeing transparency and compliance in data processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging the following security controls and measures, we can ensure strict GDPR compliance, maintain data sovereignty, and adhere to regulatory requirements such as medical confidentiality and health data protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires compliance with EU regulatory frameworks such as GDPR, as well as French regulations such as the Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client also requires that the solution does not introduce any rupture in clinical or administrative workflows and that decision-making is not automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these requirements? we should flag potential legal risks related to data protection, regulatory compliance, and liability for any disruption to clinical or administrative workflows." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As per we company context, we have experience with the French Code Commande Publique and standard public clauses such as CCAG-TIC, which could be relevant in navigating these requirements. we company, Faber IA, is a Société par actions simplifiée (SAS) registered in France, and we have administrative attestations available." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding GDPR compliance, our company context indicates that we monitor obligations related to GDPR, including Article 9 special-category data and Article 28 processing agreements, as part of we regulatory compliance. we also have professional liability insurance covering up to 10 million euros per claim, which could mitigate some risks associated with non-compliance or data breaches." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The requirement for HDS certification is specific to the hosting of health data in France." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While our company context does not explicitly state that we hold The requirement for HDS certification, our company context mentions that we can provide standard administrative attestations required for French public procurement, which might include those related to data hosting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we should verify if we infrastructure or hosting solutions comply with HDS standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Concerning the requirement that the solution must not introduce any rupture in clinical or administrative workflows and that decision-making is not automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional, our company context suggests that we understand the importance of integrating we solutions into existing workflows. we have experience with framework agreements and can lead a small consortium with hosting and integration partners, which could help in ensuring a smooth integration of we solution into the client's existing systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, the specific requirement regarding non-automated decision-making without explicit professional validation is more related to the functional and operational aspects of our solution rather than legal compliance per se. our company context does mention that we use an open-weight model under we open-weight license and a proprietary third-party model accessed under a commercial license, with documented terms and supplier dependencies. our company context also notes that our solution IP model involves proprietary software licensed to the client under a subscription or usage model for the contract term." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In conclusion, while we have a foundation for compliance with GDPR and experience with French regulatory frameworks, we should seek additional information or clarify we standing regarding HDS certification and ensure our solution design aligns with the requirements for workflow integration and decision-making validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project has a budget of 900,000 euros over 5 years, with an annual operating cost that must be compatible with the authority's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on The project, and are there any cost-optimisation strategies our can propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist staff in analysing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, the reference budget for a 5-year public contract is €900,000. our annual revenue is €6,200,000, with a near break-even result, indicating that our costs are approximately equal to our revenues.  our target gross margin percentage ranges from 25% to 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To determine our projected margin on this contractour need to consider our standard daily rates and the cost structure of The project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project has one-off project costs and recurring run costs. one-off project costs include framing, design, integration, change management, and training, which account for 30% of the total budget, or €270,000, over 18 months." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The recurring run costs, including platform subscription, hosting/infrastructure, model-inference costs, support, and maintenance, account for 70% of the total budget, or €630,000, over 5 years. our main recurring cost drivers are hosting and inference, which vary depending on the hosting tier and model option selected." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our company context notes that the sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model are more cost-efficient on the recurring side than the premium high-availability tier combined with top-tier proprietary inference." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given are, our can propose a cost-optimisation strategy by selecting the more cost-efficient hosting and model options, which would help reduce our recurring costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By doing so, our can increase our projected margin on this contractwhile still meeting the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming our can maintain our target gross margin percentage, our projected margin on this contractould be between 25% and 35% of the total contract value, which translates to €225,000 to €315,000 over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more detailed information on the specific services and resources required for The project, it is difficult to provide a more precise estimate. our finance role works with the architect to keep the proposed configuration within the authority's budget envelope while preserving an acceptable margin. our can propose a cost-optimisation strategy to the client, highlighting the benefits of selecting more cost-efficient hosting and model options, which would result in cost savings for the authority's while ensuring that our projected margin on this contractremains within our target range." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an AI solution that assists hospital staff in hospital staff daily activities, facilitates access to information, improves the quality of written outputs, and reduces processing and documentation times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must support medical coding (PMSI / ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also provide explainability and traceability of The solution outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy can we propose to meet these requirements? we can propose an AI solution that leverages we Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities, which generate answers from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus, providing grounding and explainability. we core approach ensures that every answer cites passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpusrated from, enabling traceability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To facilitate access to information, we solution can utilize hybrid retrieval, including lexical and semantic search, to quickly surface relevant information from internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulatory texts. utilize will help hospital staff efficiently find the information hospital staff need, reducing processing times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For improving the quality of written outputs, we can employ template-guided drafting, which assists in generating high-quality clinical and administrative content, such as discharge summaries, medical reports, and patient letters. we system can also provide structured extraction capabilities to support tasks like PMSI/ICD-10 coding from clinical notes. we innovation strategy involves an iterative approach with the client's experts, starting with corpus selection and curation, followed by retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and evaluation loops." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This collaborative methodology ensures that our solution meets the specific needs of the hospital staff and complies with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
